            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(c) An Employee may be assigned by Local Management to be responsible for the delivery of a formal training class covering either technical or non-technical subject matter when such responsibility includes teaching other employees in a classroom environment either on or off the job, will be paid the allowance as specified in (d) below.",
